Advanced Testimonials: Text, Audio, Video, Student/Parent Submission, and Owner Moderation

Goal:
Upgrade the testimonial system so students and parents can submit testimonials as text, audio, or video, and the Owner/Teacher can review, approve, reject, and control what appears publicly.

Important:
Do not auto-publish any testimonial.
Every testimonial must be reviewed by the Owner/Teacher before it appears on the public website.
Student and Parent testimonials should be easy to submit from their dashboards.
Owner/Teacher must receive internal notifications when a new testimonial is submitted.

==================================================
PART 1 — TESTIMONIAL TYPES
==================================================

Support testimonial formats:

1. Text testimonial
2. Audio testimonial
3. Video testimonial
4. Mixed testimonial:
   - text + audio
   - text + video

Allowed submitters:
- Student
- Parent
- Public visitor if public testimonial form already exists

Submission sources:
- student_dashboard
- parent_dashboard
- public_form
- owner_manual_entry

==================================================
PART 2 — STUDENT TESTIMONIAL SUBMISSION
==================================================

Add a clear CTA/link in Student dashboard:

Label examples:
- “Share Your Feedback”
- “Leave a Testimonial”
- “Tell us about your Arabic learning experience”

Student route:
- /student/testimonial
or
- /student/testimonials/new

Student can submit:
- Rating 1–5 stars
- Text testimonial
- Optional audio recording/upload
- Optional video upload
- Permission checkbox:
  “I allow Habiba Nabil Arabic Academy to publish this testimonial on the website or social media after review.”
- Display name preference:
  - Full name
  - First name only
  - Anonymous
- Optional level:
  - A0
  - A1
  - A2
  - B1
  - B2
  - C1
  - C2
- Optional learning goal:
  - Speaking
  - Reading & Writing
  - Work Arabic
  - Child Arabic
  - Emirati dialect
  - Other

After submit:
- Save testimonial as pending_review.
- Show success message:
  “Thank you! Your testimonial has been sent for review.”
- Create Owner notification.
- Write audit log.

