==================================================
PART 5 — PUBLIC DISPLAY
==================================================

Public pages:
- /testimonials
- Homepage testimonials section if enabled

Public testimonial cards should support:
- Text testimonial
- Audio player if approved and allowed
- Video player if approved and allowed
- Rating stars
- Display name
- Level/goal if allowed
- Parent/student label if appropriate
- Featured badge optional

Public display rules:
- Only approved testimonials appear publicly.
- Only testimonials with publish permission can appear.
- Anonymous preference must be respected.
- Do not expose private student/parent data.
- Do not show email, WhatsApp, or internal notes.

Homepage:
- Show featured approved testimonials only.
- Keep homepage fast.
- Lazy-load audio/video testimonials.
- Do not autoplay audio/video.

==================================================
PART 6 — UPLOAD AND RECORDING SUPPORT
==================================================

Audio:
- Browser audio recording if practical
- Upload fallback
- Allowed types: mp3, wav, m4a, webm
- Max size from upload settings

Video:
- Upload video if practical
- Allowed types: mp4, webm, mov if supported
- Max size from upload settings
- Show clear size/type guidance

Security:
- Validate MIME type
- Validate extension
- Validate file size
- Do not allow executable files
- Store file metadata
- Protect private files until approved
- Do not expose unapproved media publicly

Media fields:
- audioUrl
- videoUrl
- originalFilename
- mimeType
- fileSize
- duration optional
- uploadedAt

