==================================================
PART 12 — SECURITY AND PRIVACY
==================================================

Security rules:
- Student can only submit as self.
- Parent can only submit for linked child.
- Public visitors can submit only through public form.
- Owner can review all.
- Unapproved testimonials must not appear publicly.
- Private contact info must never appear publicly.
- Audio/video files must not be publicly listed before approval.
- Permission checkbox is required before public publishing.
- Anonymous display preference must be respected.
- Uploads must be validated.

