==================================================
PART 14 — ACCEPTANCE CRITERIA
==================================================

Phase is complete when:

Student:
- Student can open testimonial form from dashboard.
- Student can submit text testimonial.
- Student can upload/record audio if enabled.
- Student can upload video if enabled.
- Submission becomes pending_review.

Parent:
- Parent can open testimonial form from dashboard.
- Parent can submit testimonial for linked child.
- Parent cannot submit for unlinked child.

Owner:
- Owner receives actionable notification.
- Owner can review testimonial.
- Owner can play audio/video.
- Owner can approve/reject/archive.
- Owner can control homepage/testimonials page visibility.

Public:
- Only approved testimonials appear.
- Audio/video testimonials display correctly.
- Unapproved testimonials do not appear.
- Anonymous preferences are respected.

Security:
- Upload validation works.
- Private data is not exposed.
- Audit log records important actions.

